'''DRX''' is a [[:category:South Korea|Korean]] esports organization. They were previously known as '''KING-ZONE DragonX''' and '''DragonX'''.

Known primarily by its ''League of Legends'' team, '''DRX''' formed its fighting games division via the acquisition of [[Vision Strikers]]. They are currently competing under the name '''Kiwoom DRX''' due to sponsorship with [[wikipedia:Kiwoom Securities|Kiwoom Securities]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/drx_global/status/2034861240292446385|title=하나의 이름으로 결합된 투지와 혁신, '키움 DRX'가 새로운 도전을 시작합니다.|publisher=DRX|date=2026-03-20|language={{FlagNoLink|kr}}}}</ref>

